//    "drop"), the aK route) and appDrag = cd06fb298 g; cc63499d2 u is its drag-over state, cc63499d2 d the accent halo.
//    Generated by scripts/extract-code-composer.mjs (composer-pane-drop-zone.mjs, composer-drop-target.mjs), wired by
