//  - the /btw side-session composer is wrapped in CdsRoot like main.jsx's Code composer.
//  - the composer attachment tiles' Video tile (shared-2 Ap, c0fbbe82d gr) renders.
// Official strings are counted in the shipped minified chunks (split().length - 1); markup is SSR; the drag events run
// under a minimal hook dispatcher with fake events and a fake window. Nothing opens a window or listens on a port.
